442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Ans - Autoregressive models, such as GPT, generate text one token at a time, with each token predicted based on the previously generated tokens. This sequential approach is ideal for tasks like text generation. Masked models, like BERT, predict randomly masked tokens within a sentence, leveraging both left and right context. Autoregressive models excel in generative tasks, while masked models are better suited for understanding and classification tasks.)
/E (Ans - Autoregressive models, such as GPT, generate text one token at a time, with each token predicted based on the previously generated tokens. This sequential approach is ideal for tasks like text generation. Masked models, like BERT, predict randomly masked tokens within a sentence, leveraging both left and right context. Autoregressive models excel in generative tasks, while masked models are better suited for understanding and classification tasks.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
