/T (Ans - Positional encodings are essential in Large Language Models \(LLMs\) to address the inability of transformer architectures to capture sequence order. Since transformers process tokens simultaneously through self-attention, they are unaware of token order. Positional encodings provide the necessary information to help the model understand the sequence of words.)
/E (Ans - Positional encodings are essential in Large Language Models \(LLMs\) to address the inability of transformer architectures to capture sequence order. Since transformers process tokens simultaneously through self-attention, they are unaware of token order. Positional encodings provide the necessary information to help the model understand the sequence of words.)
