890 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Ans - At a high level, attention allows the model to focus on different parts of the input sequence when making predictions. Instead of treating every word or token equally, the model learns to "attend" to relevant words that contribute most to the current prediction, regardless of their position in the sequence.)
/E (Ans - At a high level, attention allows the model to focus on different parts of the input sequence when making predictions. Instead of treating every word or token equally, the model learns to "attend" to relevant words that contribute most to the current prediction, regardless of their position in the sequence.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
891 0 obj
